When I get nervous,
I get scared.
ເມື່ອຂ້ອຍກັງວົນ, ຂ້ອຍຢ້ານກົວ.

1947
02:23:45,737 --> 02:23:49,565
When motherfuckers get scared,
that's when motherfuckers
